<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
    <h2 style="color: #dc2626;">⚠️ 재고 부족 알림</h2>

    <div style="background: #fef2f2; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; margin: 20px 0;">
      <%= @message %>
    </div>

    <h3>상품 정보</h3>
    <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>상품명</strong></td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @product.name %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>브랜드</strong></td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @product.brand %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>카테고리</strong></td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @product.category %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>옵션</strong></td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @variant.color %> / <%= @variant.size %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>현재 재고</strong></td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #dc2626;"><%= @variant.stock %>개</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>최소 재고</strong></td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><%= @variant.min_stock %>개</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <strong>조치 필요:</strong> 긴급 재입고를 권장합니다.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">
      JIEUN Fashion OS | AI-Native Inventory Management
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
